@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

title Student fields and persisted attendance
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
class Person
class Name
class StudentId
class Email
class Remark
class Label
class AttendanceRecord
Person --> "1" Name
Person --> "1" StudentId
Person --> "1" Email
Person --> "1" Remark
Person --> "0..*" Label : current groups
Person --> "0..*" AttendanceRecord : recorded presence
AttendanceRecord --> "1" Label : group
note bottom of AttendanceRecord
Each record also holds one date.
Date + group identifies attendance for a student.
end note
@enduml
